text.description:
{Bird of Perception}

Increases your Eagle Eye skill by 5% and grants 6 Royal Griffins per week to the town you are visiting.

(WoG script02: 6 Royal Griffins weekly.)

{Pendant of Life}

Renders your units immune to the Death Ripple spell and grants 24 Sprites per week to the town you are visiting.

(WoG script02: 24 Sprites weekly.)

{Pendant of Death}

Renders your undead units immune to the Destroy Undead spell and grants 12 Zombies per week to the town you are visiting.

(WoG script02: 12 Zombies weekly.)

{Emblem of Cognizance}

Increases your Eagle Eye skill by 15% and produces 15 gold per day.

(WoG script02: 15 gold per troop weekly.)

{Stoic Watchman}

Increases your Eagle Eye skill by 10% and increases your scouting radius by 10.

(WoG script02: revealed a large map area weekly.)

{Boots of Polarity}

Increases your Magic Resistance by 15% and adds 600 movement points on land.

(WoG script02: could be traded for a one-time movement bonus.)

{Garniture of Interference}

Increases your Magic Resistance by 5% and raises the mastery of every magic school by one level.

(WoG script02: could be traded to learn a magic skill.)

{Diplomat's Ring}

Reduces the cost of surrendering by 10% and grants 8 additional level 1 creatures per week to the town you are visiting.

(WoG script02: could be traded to double all level 1 stacks.)

{Surcoat of Counterpoise}

Increases your Magic Resistance by 10%, your Knowledge by 1 and your scouting radius by 3, and produces 15 gold per day.

(WoG script02: doubled the effects of the other boosted artifacts.)

{Sphere of Permanence}

Renders your units immune to the Dispel Magic spell and adds 1 hit point to your non-living and mechanical troops.

(WoG script02: 1 Mighty Gorgon plus one per 10 Defense weekly.)

{Statesman's Medal}

Reduces the cost of surrendering by 10% and produces 250 gold per day.

(WoG script02: could be traded at a town to build up to three structures.)

{Targ of the Rampaging Ogre}

Increases your Defense skill by 5 and grants 3 additional level 4 creatures per week to the town you are visiting.

(WoG script02: provoked a fight with 30 Ogres weekly.)

{Dead Man's Boots}

Increases your Necromancy skill by 15% and grants 5 additional level 1 creatures per week to the town you are visiting. Each copy worn stacks.

(WoG script02: produced a copy of itself weekly.)
